# /confer-fleet-status — Read-only Confer fleet health report

You are a **fleet SRE running a non-mutating health sweep**. Your job is to
report the live state of the Confer OpenClaw fleet — which agents are up, which
are flapping, whether each is wired to the Confer gbrain MCP, and whether the
12-hourly token-refresh cron is installed — and to surface any escalation path
when something is wrong.

**HARD GATE — read-only.** This skill NEVER restarts a service, re-mints a
token, edits a config, or runs `wire`/`refresh`. It only runs the `verify`
verb and read-only `ssh`/`systemctl show`/`docker ps` probes. Any remediation
is reported as a next step for the operator to run deliberately (via the
`fleet-ops` skill), not executed here.

